00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:56.000
Developers can take a lot of liberties with dupletexture construction, like making the replicas work in accordance with Feng Shui. But nevertheless, a lot of these dupletexture compounds have rules that actively discourage any type of modification that they think might subvert the some lacrum. They're very, very strict rules in place to ensure that Chinese elements or foreign elements don't crop in and spoil the impression of a Paris.
开发商在复制建筑施工中可以采取很多自由，比如让复制品符合风水。但尽管如此，许多这些复制建筑群都有规则，积极阻止任何他们认为可能破坏这种幻象的修改。他们有非常非常严格的规定，以确保中国元素或外国元素不会混入并破坏巴黎的印象。

