00:03:56.000 --> 00:04:19.000
And these rules have been set up to preserve the European feel of this development. For example, no hanging laundry outside, no changing the paint, no installing air conditioners, no keeping chickens in the backyard. To further create the impression of Paris, there might be a French bakery or a bestial day celebration. There might be a pub and an Irish town or a real canal network and a knockoff Venice.
这些规则是为了保持该开发项目的欧洲风情而制定的。例如，禁止在外面晾晒衣物，禁止改变油漆颜色，禁止安装空调，禁止在后院养鸡。为了进一步营造巴黎的印象，可能会有法式面包店或巴士底日庆祝活动。爱尔兰小镇可能会有酒吧，或者在仿制的威尼斯有真正的运河网络。

